Republican candidates included Paul Allen Taylor.<ref name=CAprimarylist/>

Derrick Michael Reid ran with the Libertarian Party.<ref name=CAprimarylist/>

Independent candidates included biologist Tim Gildersleeve,<ref name=CAprimarylist/> Lee W. Olson,<ref name=CAprimarylist/> and evangelist Ling Ling Shi.<ref name=CAprimarylist/>
